  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your celestial mount is more nimble and faster than others of its kind.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Divine bond class feature with the mount option, Cha 15.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your mount gained from your divine bond class feature gains a +2 sacred bonus to its Dexterity score. In addition, its movement speed is increased by 10 feet.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/alternate-justicar#toc34\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
